# OmniOps Ship Loop

## Default command

After any fix, run:

```bash
bun run ship
```

That is typecheck + unit + lint:gate + ship-gates (CDN + wow testids) + landing/chat e2e subset.

Do **not** ask the human to read todo boards for the daily path. Prefer `docs/runbooks/daily-dev.md`.

## Git

- Work on `developeredit` or `feature/*` only.
- **Never** `git push origin main`, force-push `main`, or merge to `main` unless the human explicitly ordered it in that turn.
- Ship via PR into `main`. Details: `.github/BRANCH_PROTECTION.md`.

## Agent lanes

| Lane | Role | Does | Avoid |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| **Cursor = ship** | Wire, fix, test, short PR | `bun run ship`, CI green | Long ADR essays from scratch |
| **Claude = shape** | ADR, copy, design direction | Docs/API shape | Same branch as Cursor at once |

One agent = one branch = one PR.

## Product AI

Mistral only for app chat. No OpenAI / Lovable AI Gateway for product inference.

## After production deploy

Smoke:

1. `GET /api/ai-status` → `ok: true`, mistral
2. Open `/chat` (auth gate or workspace)

## Out of scope unless asked

Marketplace, CRDT multiplayer, Design Canvas host — do not expand ship PRs into those.
